  <name>RandomCard</name>
  <summary>Apple's HyperCard, re-created</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      RandomCard re-creates Apple's HyperCard: stacks of cards with buttons and
      fields, MacPaint-style painting, and HyperTalk scripts.
    </p>
    <p>
      It opens HyperCard stacks from the classic Mac and saves its own. Stacks can
      be in color, with icons of any size, and each can open in a window of its own.
    </p>
  </description>
